# Java format

When creating or editing Java in this repo, match `catalog/Product.java`. After a manual edit, format the whole file before finishing (do not leave trailing spaces or packed annotations).

- Indent 4 spaces. No tabs. UTF-8. LF. File ends with a newline. Trim trailing whitespace.
- Imports: `java.*` → blank → `jakarta.*` → blank → `com.garicharo.*`. No unused imports. No wildcard imports.
- One blank line between methods. No double blank lines. No space before `,` (`name = "sku"`, not `name = "sku" ,`).
- JPA: `@Entity` then `@Table` then fields. Constructor vacío + constructor de negocio. Getters/setters grouped by field.
- Money: `BigDecimal`. Snapshots on `OrderItem` have no setters except `setOrder` (for `addItem`).
- No AI comments.

```java
// ❌ BAD
@Column(name = "sku" , nullable = false )
public UUID getId() {   
    return id;
}

// ✅ GOOD
@Column(nullable = false)
private String sku;

public UUID getId() {
    return id;
}
```
